{"id":"colega","lemma":"colega","pos":"noun","rank":1035,"glosses":["colleague","buddy"],"ipa":"/koˈleɡa/","gender":"mf","forms":{"plural":"colegas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b1/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-colega.wav","examples":[{"text":"Él es mi colega.","en":"He is my colleague.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/734308","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"¿Te gustan tus colegas?","en":"Do you like your coworkers?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to like in a general…","l":"gustar"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"Mi colega y su marido son ambos americanos.","en":"My colleague and her husband are both American.","words":[{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"husband"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"both"},{"g":"American","l":"americano"}]},{"text":"No puedo hablar en nombre de todos mis colegas.","en":"I can't speak for all of my colleagues.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/728626","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to talk"},null,null,null,{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"my"},null],"phrases":[[3,6,"on behalf of"]]},{"text":"No es bueno engañar a los colegas.","en":"Deceiving your colleagues isn't good.","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"good"},{"g":"to trick"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / them"},null]}]}